                                        "sense_id": "f969cde4-abf0-3c28-ab13-68da11fdac52",
                                        "entry_id": "e31c5708-a272-364c-b5fa-517045567810",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who exercises control and direction of a military or naval organization."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0dd4a70b-65c6-464a-9478-c71d3ffec5c7",
                                                "sense_id": "f969cde4-abf0-3c28-ab13-68da11fdac52",
                                                "text": "I think if post commanders of the unchaplained posts could employ acceptable clergymen […] then the needs might be met."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f7a30bc-13f8-498a-ad52-53d1c80a2f59",
                                                "sense_id": "f969cde4-abf0-3c28-ab13-68da11fdac52",
                                                "text": "Instead, Korda squeezes Eisenhower’s extraordinary two-term presidency — not to mention his stints as president of Columbia University and commander of NATO forces — into 140 themeless pages."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
